Core k321 made the core tool loops read replies through chat_response (errors croak, Gemini thoughts filtered, chunk arrays to text) via Role::Tools::_tool_loop_response. Raider.pm (~2020-2024) still uses response_tool_calls + response_text_content, so a 200 error body ends the raid with "" and Gemini thought parts leak. Needs a public core hook (ADR 0028 style) for _tool_loop_response, then switch Raider. Blocked on a core release that exposes it.

Also pick up core k323/k324/k332: arguments_undecodable on ToolCall (drop truncated calls + remove from echo), unknown-tool error result instead of abort, duplicate tool names across MCP servers sent once.
